# The office's pages are the only routes not prerendered, so they are handed
# the app shell here. Every public page has a file of its own, and any other
# address gets dist/404.html with a 404 status. A catch-all rewrite to
# index.html used to answer every unknown address with the homepage and a 200,
# which search engines count as a soft 404 and which kept retired Wix addresses
# indexed as copies of the homepage. The /en forms cover the router's English
# basename.
/rekins         /index.html  200
/birojs         /index.html  200
/pirtnieks      /index.html  200
/apmaksa        /index.html  200
/en/rekins      /index.html  200
/en/birojs      /index.html  200
/en/pirtnieks   /index.html  200
/en/apmaksa     /index.html  200